@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #54718B
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F3F8FC
skinparam classBorderColor #355C7D
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #F3F8FC
skinparam componentBorderColor #355C7D
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F3F8FC
skinparam stateBorderColor #355C7D
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 50
title 实现类图：业务分层与服务接口
left to right direction
class Market {
+auth / accounts / products / bookings
+social / messaging / handoff / reviews
+reports / queries / places / addresses / delivery
}
class Store {
+connect()
+transaction()
}
class Auth {
+register()
+login() / require()
+provision_admin()
}
abstract class Service {
+execute() / change()
+check_version()
+sweep()
}
class Products {
+create_draft() / edit_product()
+submit() / review() / relist()
+request_restore() / resolve_restore()
}
class Bookings {
+reserve()
+act_reservation()
+handoff() / snapshot_photos()
}
class Reports {
+report_product()
+resolve_report()
}
class Queries {
+search() / detail()
+seller_profile()
+statistics() / logs()
}
class Accounts {
+profile() / update()
+change_password()
+set_status() / save_category()
}
class Social {
+favorite() / viewed() / follow()
+products() / follows()
}
class Messaging {
+open() / send()
+messages() / notices() / unread()
}
class Handoff {
+propose() / decide()
+changes()
}
class Reviews {
+submit() / public()
+report() / resolve()
}
class Places {
+list() / save() / delete()
}
class Addresses {
+list() / save() / delete() / default()
}
class Deliveries {
+ship() / correct_tracking() / confirm()
+propose_address() / decide_address()
+open_issue() / resolve_issue() / detail()
}
Market *-- Store
Market *-- Auth
Market *-- Service : 装配12类业务服务
Service --> Store : 同一事务内校验与写入
Service --> Auth : 会话与角色校验
Service <|-- Products
Service <|-- Bookings
Service <|-- Reports
Service <|-- Queries
Service <|-- Accounts
Service <|-- Social
Service <|-- Messaging
Service <|-- Handoff
Service <|-- Reviews
Service <|-- Places
Service <|-- Addresses
Service <|-- Deliveries
legend bottom
  普通用户买卖身份由商品归属和预约参与关系确定，不创建互斥角色。
  UI仅调用服务；新业务与原预约共用SQLite事务、版本和鉴权。
endlegend
@enduml
